          "text": "Lumen Labs 2027 internship program. The 2027 program offers four paid internships: Data Engineering, Photonics Research, Quality Assurance, and Technical Writing. Each internship runs for 12 weeks at the Portland laboratory. Applications close on 30 January 2027."
        },
        {
          "kind": "native",
          "stratum": "core",
          "text": "Interns receive a housing stipend of 900 credits per month. Mentors meet interns every Tuesday. The program does not offer remote placements."
